TOBAC README
Peter.R.Colarco@nasa.gov - 24Jul2026

Presumes a discover working environment per Fei Liu
Update the "fire_table.txt" file
Run ./do_tobac.csh
This reads the fire table and generates individual
JSON files for each event and then generates a run
script "run_cases.csh" that submits the jobs to the
queue. "do_tobac.csh" will then run the run-cases.csh
When jobs finish (successfully) the plots appear in
the Plots folder.
